        "r": 444.8866600000001,
        "b": 598.0641599999999
      },
      "content": "Fasten the gasket (360C) and the end cover (109A) with the bolts (371C). See the specified torque values."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1572",
      "reading_order": 1820,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99666000000002,
        "t": 594.3041599999999,
        "r": 309.19665999999984,
        "b": 583.0641599999999
      },
      "content": "Make sure that the shaft rotates freely."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0186",
      "reading_order": 1821,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 165.38841247558594,
        "t": 567.3258056640625,
        "r": 364.0901184082031,
        "b": 438.8164978027344
      },
